♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,420
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:53,470
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:54,420
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:55,940
=Episode 16=

13
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:44,760
My ex.

14
00:01:46,120 --> 00:01:47,040
Fancy seeing you again.

15
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,480
You went to such lengths

16
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,280
even pulling strings

17
00:01:55,880 --> 00:01:57,720
to become my assistant.

18
00:02:01,480 --> 00:02:02,280
Lu Mingye.

19
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,320
Are you still not over me?

20
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,320
You've got it wrong, Mr. Duan.

21
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,240
I didn't know it was you.

22
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:13,840
I applied

23
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,200
just to get the job.

24
00:02:18,440 --> 00:02:19,240
The job?

25
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,680
So many companies in Xizi City.

26
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:23,760
Why choose mine?

27
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,120
Dongchen leads the field.

28
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,960
Working here

29
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,400
would be valuable

30
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,720
on anyone's resume.

31
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:36,200
Nice speech.

32
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:39,400
Why should I hire you?

33
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:43,360
Do you think the CEO of Dongchen

34
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:45,640
still has feelings for you?

35
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:51,160
Here.

36
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:52,960
Feel it.

37
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:55,120
It's only beating

38
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,360
for projects and profit.

39
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:57,800
Would you keep someone

40
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:59,280
you've dated before

41
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,480
as your assistant?

42
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,680
Are you afraid to hire someone

43
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,600
you've dated?

44
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,280
Keep me,

45
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:15,800
and prove you can be impartial

46
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,360
and open-minded.

47
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,400
(DONGCHEN GROUP)
Dongchen's no refuge.

48
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,600
I only care about results

49
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,200
and value.

50
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:35,520
I'll prove it to you.

51
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:36,800
Choosing me

52
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,240
will be Dongchen's gain.

53
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,160
Fine.

54
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,720
Show me your value.

55
00:03:48,200 --> 00:03:50,280
Not your worthless past.

56
00:04:01,640 --> 00:04:02,400
Next week

57
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:04,000
is Dongchen's art show debut
in Xizi City.

58
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:05,520
I'm planning to bring in

59
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,000
an old craftsman named Zhou Yishan

60
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,760
as art consultant.

61
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,200
That's the file Zhan Xiang

62
00:04:09,200 --> 00:04:10,320
put together on him.

63
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:11,240
Hand it over.

64
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,120
Closer.

65
00:04:32,560 --> 00:04:33,960
You took Lu Qian's job

66
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:35,400
and got punished again?

67
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,680
That's personal.

68
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,560
Personal?

69
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:47,060
(DONGCHEN GROUP)

70
00:05:19,340 --> 00:05:19,980
(DONGCHEN GROUP)

71
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,920
Since you joined Dongchen,

72
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:09,400
your business is mine.

73
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,360
I won't pay top dollar

74
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,600
for an assistant who's hurt

75
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,280
and can't work efficiently.

76
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:28,600
The file says

77
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,480
Zhou Yishan retired

78
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:32,080
ten years ago.

79
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,040
He hasn't taken

80
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,480
any commercial work since.

81
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,400
He runs a pottery studio.

82
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:38,320
He's looking for couple models.

83
00:06:38,920 --> 00:06:40,400
I can get him to agree.

84
00:06:40,800 --> 00:06:42,120
But you'll need to help.

85
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,000
So you want me

86
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,920
to fake a relationship?

87
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:49,480
Any guy

88
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:51,320
at the company could do that.

89
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,880
No need to trouble you.

90
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:55,080
I prefer to handle things myself.

91
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:56,800
Men are easy to find.

92
00:06:57,360 --> 00:06:58,840
But an ex of yours...

93
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,000
I'm the only one.

94
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,720
No one else compares.

95
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,520
Mr. Zhou.

96
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,480
We're here to audition as couple models.

97
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,960
Have a seat.

98
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:17,160
This time,

99
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:18,640
I'm making a pair of pottery plates.

100
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:21,200
I used clay aged a full year.

101
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:24,960
I'm looking for a couple
who's been together for a year.

102
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:26,120
as my models.

103
00:07:26,360 --> 00:07:28,480
To symbolize fate.

104
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:29,520
Nice.

105
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,040
We've been together

106
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,480
exactly one year.

107
00:07:34,080 --> 00:07:34,920
Then tell me,

108
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:37,240
how did you meet?

109
00:07:38,320 --> 00:07:39,160
Well...

110
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,000
We met at a hotel.

111
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,600
It was crowded that day.

112
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,680
But I spotted her at first glance.

113
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,520
She stood in the light.

114
00:07:47,400 --> 00:07:48,480
So unique.

115
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:53,520
She came over and said just two things.

116
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:55,200
The first was...

117
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,040
(Single?)

118
00:07:58,160 --> 00:07:59,080
The second was...

119
00:07:59,640 --> 00:08:00,480
Sex.

120
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:04,520
Tax. She meant tax.

121
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:06,080
She'd just come back,

122
00:08:06,320 --> 00:08:07,280
with an overseas

123
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,120
tax issue to sort out.

124
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,120
She asked if anyone there

125
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:13,240
knew foreign tax law.

126
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:14,480
I said I did.

127
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,320
She said, "Then tax it."

128
00:08:16,520 --> 00:08:19,600
Means she needed help with her taxes.

129
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:21,680
Doing taxes led to...

130
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:23,200
holding her close.

131
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,200
Nice tax work.

132
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,080
I've heard the story.

133
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,520
Now let's see your chemistry.

134
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:36,240
Here.

135
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,080
Besides the day you met,

136
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,880
write down

137
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,880
your most unforgettable day.

138
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,400
Turn away.

139
00:09:00,540 --> 00:09:05,540
♪They all believe♪

140
00:09:05,980 --> 00:09:12,140
♪Love begins at first sight♪

141
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:19,540
♪When Cupid's arrow flies♪
(BUS STAND)

142
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,280
(When I move forward,)

143
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,080
(you step back.)

144
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:23,600
(Three, two, one.)

145
00:09:26,300 --> 00:09:28,660
(BUS STAND)

146
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,120
(The day we broke up.)

147
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:33,720
(I'll never forget it.)

148
00:09:33,720 --> 00:09:37,500
♪Passing by under green lights♪

149
00:09:40,140 --> 00:09:45,980
♪In the airport corner, bags between us♪
(BUS STAND)

150
00:09:46,580 --> 00:09:50,900
♪Or someone dialed the wrong number♪

151
00:09:54,160 --> 00:09:57,000
(That's the day I hurt him most.)

152
00:09:59,060 --> 00:10:05,700
♪Close, then apart,
teasing us one by one♪

153
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:12,140
♪Cover both ears, hide all the clues♪

154
00:10:12,580 --> 00:10:16,500
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

155
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:21,020
♪One by one, they pass
before love is entrusted♪

156
00:10:22,020 --> 00:10:25,100
(July 1st)

157
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,880
All right.

158
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:34,440
So tell me,

159
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:37,880
why did you both choose this day?

160
00:10:42,680 --> 00:10:43,680
Because that day,

161
00:10:45,640 --> 00:10:47,360
I knew how much she loved me.

162
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,000
That day,

163
00:10:53,120 --> 00:10:54,520
our relationship

164
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:57,240
entered a whole new stage.

165
00:10:58,040 --> 00:10:58,640
Yes.

166
00:10:59,000 --> 00:10:59,840
A stage

167
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:02,240
where even apart,

168
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,760
we know each other's minds.

169
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,520
That kind of bond

170
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:07,560
is rare in couples.

171
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:09,960
Good.

172
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:12,880
Now, I need a hand mold.

173
00:11:13,160 --> 00:11:14,640
The man makes the mold,

174
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,320
the woman shapes it.

175
00:11:18,340 --> 00:11:22,940
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

176
00:11:25,860 --> 00:11:32,260
♪A love letter written in song♪

177
00:11:32,500 --> 00:11:37,580
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

178
00:11:39,940 --> 00:11:46,060
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

179
00:11:46,460 --> 00:11:52,620
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

180
00:11:53,140 --> 00:12:00,100
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

181
00:12:00,580 --> 00:12:07,260
♪I'll read every look on your face♪

182
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:14,220
♪Gemini's joy, a little magic for you♪

183
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:19,420
♪Close your eyes and count♪

184
00:12:19,940 --> 00:12:24,420
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

185
